# Good Sites for your Old Macs

## Some awesome pages to get your old Mac up and running!

[Macintosh Garden - A good resource for downloading old apps and games](http://macintoshgarden.org)
[Macintosh Repository - Another good resource for old apps and games](http://macintoshrepository.org)
[Apple Fool - Information about Macs and Mac Networking](http://www.applefool.com/se30/)
[MacFixer - A useful site for downloading software for computers old as the Apple II!](http://obsolete.macfixer.com/vintage-software/)
[FrogFind - A search engine created by YouTuber Action Retro, designed to run smoothly on basically any computer that has internet access.](http://frogfind.com/)
[iFixIt - A huge site full of computer repair guides (may not load on an old mac.)](http://www.ifixit.com)

